 "notes": [
  "On 1h, the first red Heikin Ashi candle gave 20,786 short entries in 283 separate moves. Twenty candles later, price was 0.05% lower than after random candles, and the luck band tops out at 0.03%. The gap also shows at 50 and 100 candles but not at 10. It holds without its strongest stretch, between Apr 27, 2022 and Jul 11, 2022.",
  "If you split it by trend, neither half holds on its own. In uptrends the result rests on signals between Sep 1, 2020 and Sep 23, 2020. In downtrends it rests on the stretch between Apr 27, 2022 and Jul 11, 2022, and without either stretch it is the same as random. By coin, ETH was the same as random, and BTC and SOL each rest on a stretch that began on Apr 26, 2022.",
  "On 1h, a third green candle in a row beat random by 0.06% after 20 candles, but at 10, 50 and 100 candles it was the same as random. Taken separately, uptrends and downtrends were both the same as random. On ETH the result rests on signals between Dec 24, 2020 and Jan 10, 2021, and on SOL on signals between Jan 6, 2021 and Jan 11, 2021. BTC was the same as random.",
  "On 4h and daily, the green streak did the same as random: 0.12% on 4h and 0.41% on daily, both inside the luck band. Uptrends and downtrends were the same as random on both timeframes. On daily, no single coin has enough moves to judge.",
  "On 4h, shorting the first red candle beat random by 0.15%, just above a band that ends at 0.14%. It rests on signals between Jul 29, 2022 and Jan 1, 2023, and it shows at 50 candles but not at 10 or 100. In uptrends it beat random by 0.24%, carried by the stretch between Oct 29, 2021 and Jan 19, 2022, and in downtrends it was the same as random. On daily the short has only 22 moves, under the 30 needed, so it was not judged.",
  "On these pairs, a green Heikin Ashi streak adds nothing to a long bot's entry timing, so the DCA orders and take profit do the work. The first red candle on 1h is the only setting where price leaned one way, and the lean is small. Use it as a filter beside other conditions on a short bot, or as a reason to hold back a long entry. It shrinks to nothing in any trend that lacks a strong stretch to carry it."
